  "description": "<h2>ENGWE P275 Pro Features</h2>\n<p>1. 260 KM long range</p>\n<p>2. 250W mid-drive motor with 65Nm torque</p>\n<p>3. Gates carbon belt</p>\n<p>4. Elite built</p>\n<p>5. Puncture resistant reflectiv tires</p>\n<p>6. Torque sensor</p>\n<p>7. Step-over design</p>\n<h2>What About ENGWE P275 Pro?</h2>\n<p>The ENGWE P275 Pro Urban E-Bike is designed for both performance and comfort, offering an impressive 260 km long range, making it ideal for long commutes and extended rides. Powered by a 250W mid-drive motor with 65Nm of torque, it delivers a smooth and powerful riding experience, allowing riders to effortlessly tackle hills and varying terrains. The electric city bicycle is equipped with a durable Gates carbon belt, providing a maintenance-free, smooth, and quiet ride. Additionally, puncture-resistant reflective tires enhance safety, offering better visibility while minimizing the risk of flats.</p>\n<p>With a torque sensor, the commuter e bike ENGWE P275 Pro intelligently adjusts motor assistance based on the rider's pedaling effort, ensuring a responsive and efficient ride. Built with an elite-level construction, this urban ebike combines style, reliability, and performance, making it the perfect choice for urban commuting and weekend adventures.</p>\n<h2>ENGWE P275 Pro Urban E Bike Spec</h2>\n<table border=\"2\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Material</td>\n<td>6061 Aluminum Alloy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Motor</td>\n<td>Bafang 250W Brushless Mid-drive Motor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Torque</td>\n<td>65 N.m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tires</td>\n<td>27.5 x 2.4 Spoke Tires</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transmission System</td>\n<td>Bafang 3 levels automatical gear shifter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Belt</td>\n<td>Gates carbon belt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brake</td>\n<td>180mm Front &amp; Rear Tektro hydraulic disc brakes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display</td>\n<td>Bafang TFT DP C244</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Battery</td>\n<td>36V 19.2Ah SAMSUNG Lithium-ion*1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Speed</td>\n<td>25 km/h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mileage</td>\n<td>260 km (PAS 1 level) 150 km (PAS 5 level)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Charging Time</td>\n<td>about 3-8H (The charging time of the battery depends on the usage of the battery.)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maximum Climbing degree</td>\n<td>10\u00b0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bike Weight</td>\n<td>25.3 kg (55.77 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gross Weight</td>\n<td>32.5 kg (71.65 lbs)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
